` with no `surface` keyword writes at the AC-1.1 path (existing"},{"line_number":34,"content":"  - AC-1.5: among the WRITE-path modules (`h_mad_audit_cycle.py`, `h_mad_collect_report.py`)"},{"line_number":40,"content":"  - AC-1.6: **Disjoint namespace, proven by property, not by a production assert.** A"},{"line_number":49,"content":"    the docs pattern loses its `.audit.v` dots (force) → AC-1.1/1.2 bite. `_collected_path`"},{"line_number":52,"content":"### FR-2: `h_mad_collect_report.py` — the codex-leg collector"},{"line_number":75,"content":"- **Acceptance Criteria**:"},{"line_number":76,"content":"  - AC-2.1: With `<RP>` present, non-empty, `<RP>.done` present, and no existing docs file:"},{"line_number":77,"content":"    prints `COLLECT: OK path=<AC-1.2 path> delivered=report-file`, exit 0, and the docs file's"},{"line_number":79,"content":"  - AC-2.2: With `<RP>` absent and no `--out` (or `--out` absent/empty): prints"},{"line_number":80,"content":"    `COLLECT: MISSING path=<AC-1.2 path> delivered=none`, exit 0, and no file exists at the"},{"line_number":82,"content":"  - AC-2.3: With `<RP>` present but `<RP>.done` absent, and `--grace 0`: verdict is `MISSING`"},{"line_number":84,"content":"  - AC-2.4: With the docs file already present and byte-identical to `<RP>`: `COLLECT: OK …"},{"line_number":86,"content":"  - AC-2.5: With the docs file already present and DIFFERENT from `<RP>`: `COLLECT: CONFLICT"},{"line_number":90,"content":"  - AC-2.6: With `<RP>` absent and `--out <out>` present containing a sentinel-wrapped report"},{"line_number":93,"content":"  - AC-2.6a: `<RP>` absent, `--out` valid, docs file present with DIFFERENT bytes →"},{"line_number":96,"content":"  - AC-2.6b: `<RP>` absent, `--out` valid, docs file present and identical to the extracted"},{"line_number":98,"content":"  - AC-2.7: `--surface p2` (or any `p\\d+`) → exit 2, stderr names the token, no `COLLECT:` line."},{"line_number":100,"content":"  - AC-2.8: When `--report` resolves (`Path.resolve()`) to the derived docs path itself:"},{"line_number":104,"content":"  - AC-2.9: **Incident replay** (suite test, synthetic bytes) — in an isolated project root"},{"line_number":112,"content":"  - AC-2.10: Operational errors exit 2 and print **no** `COLLECT:` line: `--project-root`"},{"line_number":115,"content":"  - AC-2.12: Readback: with the writer patched to land wrong bytes (test seam), the CLI"},{"line_number":117,"content":"    the marker remover patched to a no-op, the AC-2.8 case exits 2 likewise."},{"line_number":118,"content":"  - AC-2.11: Existing-identical docs file with `--surface` given and `<RP>.done` absent →"},{"line_number":122,"content":"### FR-3: The gate refuses a transport file"},{"line_number":126,"content":"  other importers are the tests (AC-1.6, AC-3.5a). Neither the CLI nor `_collected_path`"},{"line_number":143,"content":"  (`audit_f.plan.audit.v8.report.md`) is NOT transport (it has dots) — AC-1.6 pins that no"},{"line_number":147,"content":"  keep their verdict — pinned by AC-3.7."},{"line_number":148,"content":"- **Acceptance Criteria**:"},{"line_number":149,"content":"  - AC-3.1: `h_mad_audit_gate.py /tmp/audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md` on a well-formed"},{"line_number":154,"content":"  - AC-3.2: The same bytes at `docs/01-plan/features/f.plan.audit.v3.codex.md` gate normally"},{"line_number":156,"content":"  - AC-3.3: `h_mad_audit_cycle.gate()` handed a transport-stem path returns"},{"line_number":159,"content":"  - AC-3.4: `h_mad_do_preconditions.py` is unaffected: it reads docs paths only (existing"},{"line_number":161,"content":"  - AC-3.5: The refusal is by **basename grammar**, not directory: `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md`"},{"line_number":167,"content":"  - AC-3.5a: **Shared corpus, both directions** — one fixture list of names with an expected"},{"line_number":180,"content":"  - AC-3.7: **Verdict preservation** — for every `*.audit.v*.md` under this repo's `docs/`"},{"line_number":183,"content":"  - AC-3